OL,3,GNEWSANo closure for terror victims,
OL,4,Asays Burnham, as survivors tell
OL,5,Aceremony about life after attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday is the UK's first national day
OL,8,Ffor those impacted by terrorism, for
OL,9,Fwhich a ceremony is taking place in
OL,10,Fcentral London
OL,12,FIn his opening remarks, chair of the
OL,13,FNational Emergencies Trust Gerald
OL,14,FOppenheim thanks various officials for
OL,15,Fattending, including Andy Burnham
OL,17,FEarlier, the room observed a two-minute
OL,18,Fsilence and there was a musical
OL,19,Fperformance on a harp
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
