OL,3,GNEWSANo closure for terror victims,
OL,4,Asays Burnham, as survivors tell
OL,5,Aceremony about life after attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FPaul Price, a survivor of the 2017
OL,8,FManchester Arena attack, says "I will
OL,9,Fnever be the man I was", adding that
OL,10,Fpart of him died along with his
OL,11,Fpartner, Elaine
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Thelma Stober, a survivor of
OL,14,Fthe 7/7 London bombings, says victims
OL,15,Ffeel the effects for "years and
OL,16,Fdecades" as opposed to the "seconds or
OL,17,Fminutes" of the attack itself
